OL,3,GNEWSACouncil gets most representations
OL,4,Aever over data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA data centre at a former nuclear site
OL,7,Fin southern Scotland has generated the
OL,8,Fmost representations ever received by a
OL,9,Fcouncil's planning department.
OL,11,FThe local authority in Dumfries and
OL,12,FGalloway is working its way through
OL,13,Fmore than 10,000 submissions over CX
OL,14,FTech's proposals for the Chapelcross
OL,15,Fsite near Annan.
OL,17,FA final consultation window closes on
OL,18,F29 November and, once it passes,
OL,19,Fplanning officers will complete the
OL,20,Fprocessing and verification of the
OL,21,Frepresentations received.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
