OL,3,GNEWSACouncil gets most representations
OL,4,Aever over data centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the total number of
OL,7,Frepresentations, names of those making
OL,8,Fthem and a summary of matters raised
OL,9,Fwould be made available on its website
OL,10,F"well ahead" of any decision on the
OL,11,Fplan's fate.
